Description: BGNOME Desktop - Custom Obsidian Amber Glass Theme for Debian
 Completely redesigned GNOME Shell, GTK4/libadwaita and GTK3 theme
 built from scratch. Features smoked glass panels, specular rim
 highlights, warm amber/copper accents, 4K procedural wallpapers,
 and default GSettings overrides for Debian-based distributions.
